      "problem": "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/differential/14150242/assets/aae6528f576b58fb5cea5238a921074d2176f9e9c9e6fc0ba3e98bc2f647e133.png)\n\nConsider the region $R$ shown above. Let the function $f(x,y)$ be defined as\n\n$$\nf(x,y)=\\{\\begin{aligned}\\sqrt{xy}, & (x,y)\\in S, \\\\ 0, & (x,y)\\in T, \\\\ {x}^{2}+{y}^{2}, & (x,y)\\in U.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen,\n\n$$\n{∬}_{R}f(x,y)\\text{ }\\text{d}A=\n$$",
